2. Model weights
   The released RoboDream weights were initialized from the NVIDIA
   Cosmos-Predict2-2B-Video2World base model and are distributed for
   non-commercial use under CC BY-NC 4.0. As a derivative of the NVIDIA base
   model, the weights are additionally subject to the terms of the NVIDIA Open
   Model License.

3. Data
   The released dataset (robot-only renders, priors, T5 embeddings and clip
   lists, Hugging Face Jay-Ye/RoboDream-Data) and the DROID clips and
   trajectories in demos/ are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International (CC BY 4.0). They are derived from DROID (CC BY 4.0); the raw
   DROID data is not redistributed.
